OL,3,GNEWSALandmark building safeguarded by
OL,4,A#250k grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "important historical landmark"
OL,7,Flying derelict will soon be brought
OL,8,Fback into use after receiving a
OL,9,F#250,000 grant.
OL,11,FKnown by local residents as the Cheers
OL,12,Fbuilding, the Grade II listed property
OL,13,Fon South Street in Boston town centre
OL,14,Fhas stood empty for several years.
OL,16,FBoston Borough Council has now granted
OL,17,F#250,000 to Blackfriars Arts Centre to
OL,18,Fcarry out improvements, with the
OL,19,Fbuilding set to become a community arts
OL,20,Fhub and pop-up museum.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
