OL,3,GNEWSALandmark building safeguarded by
OL,4,A#250k grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Dale Broughton, leader of
OL,7,Fthe authority, said he was "absolutely
OL,8,Fdelighted" to fund the renovation,
OL,9,Fwhich he said "holds so many memories"
OL,10,Ffor local people.
